{"id":873,"name":"Genmu Senki Leda","slug":"genmu_senki_leda","synopsis":"Asagiri Yohko is an ordinary high school student, and she is in love with a boy who does not know it. To help things along, she has written a song to explain how she feels but that song has quite a bit more than a couple of good bridges. \n\nYohko learns that while she is listening to her song, she is transported to Earth's other-dimensional sister world \"Ashanti.\" This song has the potential to open a gateway between Earth and Ashanti wide enough for a conquering force to invade and take over. And it is exactly why it was forbidden eons ago by the legendary warrior Leda who saw this coming.\n\nThis Leda warrior's duty now falls to Yohko and some newfound friends to stop the onslaught and return the 2 worlds in balance. \n\nMaybe Yohko is not so ordinary after all. \n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)","format":"OVA","season":"WINTER","year":1985,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:47","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 02:16:03","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":2196},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":2196},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":1989},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":3339},{"site":"ANN","externalId":2133},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":3259}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1741,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/HLgIapte2OajEcn1MbAjnRvMyf5eYVTADbEyKizZ.jpg"},{"id":1742,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/l4QtVOaXLH957PmHC6pNYQmqAnLNNZnRkbKlujew.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":189,"name":"Kaname Productions","slug":"kaname_productions"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":244,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":244,"title":"Yukue-fumei no Heart-tachi","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":272,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":12553,"basename":"GenmuSenkiLeda-OP1.webm","filename":"GenmuSenkiLeda-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/GenmuSenkiLeda-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":74858918,